OL,3,GNEWSA'Flood roadshow won't help us,'
OL,4,Asay residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn advice roadshow has paid a visit to
OL,7,Fa Lincolnshire town recently hit by
OL,8,Fflooding ` but some affected residents
OL,9,Fsay it will do little to stop the
OL,10,Fproblem happening again.
OL,12,FThe Environment Agency's FloodMobile
OL,13,Froadshow was in Boston on Wednesday in
OL,14,Fthe wake of a flood in January last
OL,15,Fyear caused by heavy rainfall.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
