OL,3,GNEWSA'Flood roadshow won't help us,'
OL,4,Asay residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut some residents said there had been
OL,7,Flittle progress on implementing the
OL,8,Frecommendations made following an
OL,9,Finvestigation into that flood, with
OL,10,Fcampaigner Andy Robinson calling for
OL,11,Fthe necessary infrastructure
OL,12,Fimprovements to be made.
OL,14,FAt the roadshow, the agency's Peter
OL,15,FReilly said: "There is always what we
OL,16,Fcall residual risk, however well
OL,17,Fprotected people are."
